{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33371","headline":"春风扇微和 · 公乘亿","name":"春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丽日催迟景，和风扇早春。\n暖浮丹凤阙，韶媚黑龙津。\n澹荡迎仙仗，霏微送画轮。\n绿摇宫柳散，红待禁花新。\n舞席潜回雪，歌筵暗起尘。\n幸当阳候律，一顾及佳晨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"公乘亿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}